   ],
   "html": "<p>The Fantastic Four made its mark on July 4th with a larger-than-life stunt designed to surprise, delight and dominate social feeds. A massive sand sculpture in the shape of the legendary “4” rose from the shore, turning heads and stopping beachgoers in their tracks.</p>\n<p>Combined with custom branded giveaways, this moment blended spectacle with sentiment, driving connection and content from families, fans and media.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "THE SCULPTURE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The activation centered around a sand sculpture of the iconic Fantastic Four emblem, brought to life by a team of world-class sand artists. Sculpted directly into the San Clemente shoreline, the 44-foot-wide installation pushed the limits of space and scale, delivering a bold visual statement with cinematic flair.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Unveiled on July 4th through Marvel Studios’ social channels, the massive \"4\" became a focal point of the beach, drawing curious beachgoers who brought the \"Fantastic\" spirit to life, turning the stunt into a shared celebration of summer, spectacle, and superhero storytelling.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/69dfcf9d97eded2b293eecd7_IHC2025_0703_114626-1725_KKB-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/69dfcf9d2b887e52f1e33d59_IHC2025_0703_165244-2099_KKB-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/69dfcf9eba6dab7d6febc785_IHC2025_0703_174619-2187_KKB-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/69dfcf9e62604782e7434e49_IHC2025_0704_092206-2208_KKB-p-2000.avif",
       "alt": ""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "GIVEAWAYS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>To elevate the on-site experience, Fantastic Four-branded umbrellas were handed out and placed around the sand sculpture. Each umbrella came with a custom carrying case, encouraging guests to take them home and extend the \"Fantastic\" energy throughout the summer. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Brand ambassadors engaged beachgoers with additional giveaways, including Fantastic Four hats, Snapple, and Pop-Tarts creating fun, fan-forward touchpoints that reinforced the spirit of the Fourth. </p>"
    },
